Content
Empathy Map
1. User Says
"I should only access the records I am authorized to view."
"I need appropriate permissions for my work."
"Unauthorized users should not access my branch records."
"The administrator should be able to manage all records."
2. User Thinks
Is my information protected?
Who can access these records?
Can another user modify my records?
Are permissions correctly configured?
Can the administrator manage access when required?
3. User Does
Logs into ServiceNow.
Accesses institution records.
Performs permitted operations.
Creates or updates records when authorized.
Reports or avoids unauthorized access.
4. User Feels
Secure when access is properly controlled.
Concerned when unauthorized access is possible.
Confident when permissions are clearly defined.
Satisfied when the system provides reliable access control.
5. User Needs
Secure record access.
Clearly defined permissions.
Branch-based restrictions.
Reliable ACL enforcement.
Administrator support.
